{"id":"n1-201","title":"～とすれば (～to sureba)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Used to express 'if it were the case that...', 'if we assume that...'.","longExplanation":"The ～とすれば grammar point poses a hypothetical condition and then draws a conclusion or inference. It translates as 'if we suppose/assume that...' or 'if it is the case that...'.","formation":"Verb-casual + とすれば / い-Adjective + とすれば / な-Adjective + だとすれば / Noun + だとすれば","examples":[{"jp":"彼が嘘つきだとすれば、その話は信じられない。","romaji":"Kare ga usotsuki da to sureba, sono hanashi wa shinjirarenai.","en":"If he’s a liar, then his story can’t be believed.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"嘘つき","vocabId":"1172460","reading":"うそつき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話","vocabId":"1600900","reading":"はなし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"信じ","vocabId":"1359040","reading":"しんじる","baseForm":"信じる"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"あなたが一緒に行くとすれば、私も行きます。","romaji":"Anata ga issho ni iku to sureba, watashi mo ikimasu.","en":"If you are going, I'll go too.","words":[{"surface":"あなた","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一緒","vocabId":"1163400","reading":"いっしょ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼が浮気しているとすれば、どうすればいい？","romaji":"Kare ga uwaki shite iru to sureba, dou sureba ii?","en":"If he’s cheating, what should I do?","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"浮気","vocabId":"1497450","reading":"うわき"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"すれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"？","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"その薬が効かないとすれば、他の方法を試すべきだ。","romaji":"Sono kusuri ga kikanai to sureba, hoka no houhou o tamesu beki da.","en":"If that medicine doesn’t work, we should try something else.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"薬","vocabId":"1538160","reading":"くすり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"効か","vocabId":"1591100","reading":"きく","baseForm":"効く"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"他","vocabId":"1203260","reading":"ほか"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"方法","vocabId":"1517090","reading":"ほうほう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試す","vocabId":"1312260","reading":"ためす"},{"surface":"べき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"べし"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]}]}